      "id": "a1",
      "voice": "anchor",
      "text": "Tonight: man builds app in a weekend.",
      "hl": "in a weekend"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b",
      "voice": "anchor",
      "text": "In a month, he won't remember how.",
      "hl": "won't remember how"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1",
      "voice": "reporter",
      "text": "The app will. Apprentice was there.",
      "say": "[deadpan] The app will. Apprentice was there.",
      "hl": "Apprentice was there."
    },
    {
      "id": "a2",
      "voice": "anchor",
      "text": "Gustaf builds by talking to agents: a hundred and twenty sessions in three weeks.",
      "caption": "Gustaf builds by talking to agents: 120 sessions in three weeks.",
      "hl": "120 sessions"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2",
      "voice": "reporter",
      "text": "The code stays. The why stays in the prompts. Apprentice reads the logs and remembers how it was built.",
      "hl": "The why|remembers how it was built"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3",
      "voice": "anchor",
      "text": "It picks up his rules without asking.",
      "hl": "without asking"
    },
    {
      "id": "r3",
      "voice": "reporter",
      "text": "Said twice: stop asking, just publish. Now a rule.",
      "caption": "Said twice: “Ja sluta fråga publicera.” Now a rule.",
      "hl": "“Ja sluta fråga publicera.”"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4",
      "voice": "anchor",
      "text": "It waits for a pause. Then it calls him.",
      "hl": "waits for a pause"
    },
    {
      "id": "g1",
      "voice": "apprentice",
      "text": "Tell me about Hack Nation. What do you remember?",
      "caption": "“Tell me about HACKNATION. What do you remember?”",
      "hl": "What do you remember?"
    },
    {
      "id": "r4",
      "voice": "reporter",
      "text": "When anyone, or any agent, is about to break a rule, it stops them. In his own words.",
      "hl": "it stops them|In his own words."
    },
    {
      "id": "a5",
      "voice": "anchor",
      "text": "His week arrives as a news bulletin. Like this one.",
      "hl": "Like this one."
    },
    {
      "id": "r5",
      "voice": "reporter",
      "text": "He did not record this video. He was tired. We were there.",
      "say": "[deadpan] He did not record this video. He was tired. We were there.",
      "hl": "We were there."
    },
    {
      "id": "a6",
      "voice": "anchor",
      "text": "Apprentice. Learning by doing, without the forgetting.",
      "caption": false
    }
